#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-kitcan.rst:63 286ffe7d6ca742bebd426b04247a406e
msgid ""
"As delivered, the KitCAN will discover a MS5525 Airspeed sensor and/or any "
"standard ArduPilot supported I2C Magnetometer that is connected to its I2C "
"external bus"
msgstr ""
"KitCAN 出厂时会自动识别连接到其外部 I2C 总线的 MS5525 空速传感器和/或任何 ArduPilot 标准支持的 I2C 磁力计"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-kitcan.rst:66 2d2a4ef0da2843cd85a2cbfc2783d66c
msgid "Typical System"
msgstr "典型系统"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-kitcan.rst:68 1e1a3df4f0c94ccfad4254d6988069c1
msgid ""
"In this case, the Kitcan is connected to an :ref:`mRo Pixracer <common-"
"pixracer-overview>` autopilot via CAN and is providing the intefaces for a "
"MS5525 airspeed sensor and a typical GPS/Compass combo, the `mRo SAM GPS + "
"IST8308 Mag <https://store.mrobotics.io/product-p/mro10037.htm>`_"
msgstr ""
"在此案例中，KitCAN 通过 CAN 连接到 :ref:`mRo Pixracer <common-pixracer-overview>` 飞控，并为"
" MS5525 空速传感器和典型 GPS/罗盘组合 `mRo SAM GPS + IST8308 Mag "
"<https://store.mrobotics.io/product-p/mro10037.htm>`_ 提供接口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-kitcan.rst:75 a1558dc5090844a3bed0333ebc9cab12
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-kitcan.rst:77 2158e627fd924c80b26d946fb7bf45ab
msgid ""
"Verify the following parameters are set on your autopilot via your ground "
"station."
msgstr "通过地面站在飞控上确认以下参数已正确设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-kitcan.rst:79 73d8bce6a6aa4f70aa324a4e95db248e
msgid ""
":ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER<CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1 (assuming its on the first CAN bus "
"of the autopilot)"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER<CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1（假设连接在飞控的第一路 CAN 总线上）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-kitcan.rst:80 b3dfbbdd3a07415581014bb35a538067
msgid ""
":ref:`GPS1_TYPE<GPS1_TYPE>` = 9 (DroneCAN) or if it will be the secondary "
"GPS, set instead"
msgstr ":ref:`GPS1_TYPE<GPS1_TYPE>` = 9（DroneCAN），如果作为辅助 GPS 则改设"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-kitcan.rst:81 990f3c85a600423a86d1e27e1f2410eb
msgid ":ref:`GPS2_TYPE<GPS2_TYPE>` = 9 (DroneCAN)"
msgstr ":ref:`GPS2_TYPE<GPS2_TYPE>` = 9（DroneCAN）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-kitcan.rst:82 86529b320d01452baa8cda87dfddc64f
msgid "Reboot"
msgstr "重启"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-kitcan.rst:84 9ef3ee46ea9e4ac3a864157b778805b9
msgid ""
"Make sure the DroneCAN compass driver is not disabled. "
"(:ref:`COMPASS_DISBLMSK<COMPASS_DISBLMSK>` bit 9 should not be set)."
msgstr ""
"确保 DroneCAN 罗盘驱动未被禁用。（:ref:`COMPASS_DISBLMSK<COMPASS_DISBLMSK>` 的第 9 "
"位不应被设置）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-kitcan.rst:86 52eb9c752be8453a95144c8c8dafaaab
msgid ""
"If your controller has multiple compasses attached already, you may want to "
"set the attached compass as a higher priority than others, if it has better "
"precision or performance."
msgstr "如果飞控上已连接多个罗盘，且该罗盘精度或性能更佳，可以将其优先级设置高于其他罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-kitcan.rst:88 933614c1660a4dfeb34276c782a7c966
msgid "To enable the integrated I2C RGB LED set:"
msgstr "启用集成 I2C RGB LED，请设置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-kitcan.rst:90 81f8a94a50e746738c581b83ec08411a
msgid ""
":ref:`NTF_LED_TYPES<NTF_LED_TYPES>` bit 5 (DroneCAN) should be set in the "
"autopilot."
msgstr "飞控中应设置 :ref:`NTF_LED_TYPES<NTF_LED_TYPES>` 的第 5 位（DroneCAN）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-kitcan.rst:92 c5f825cb250c4a35bc383d70f1d6c86c
msgid ""
"The integrated safety switch is automatically used, if the autopilot has "
"enabled the use of safety switches via "
":ref:`BRD_SAFETY_DEFLT<BRD_SAFETY_DEFLT>` is \"1\" (default).  "
"(``BRD_SAFETYENABLE`` in older firmware versions)"
msgstr ""
"如果飞控通过 :ref:`BRD_SAFETY_DEFLT<BRD_SAFETY_DEFLT>` = "
"「1」（默认值）启用了安全开关使用，则集成安全开关将自动被使用。（旧版固件中为 ``BRD_SAFETYENABLE``）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-kitcan.rst:94 3d07a77db48f4a2d96d5dc2ae480dc80
msgid "If you want to enable an attached I2C airspeed sensor, set:"
msgstr "如需启用外接 I2C 空速传感器，请设置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-kitcan.rst:96 911a2c7481b64368a18e31aebc764056
msgid ":ref:`ARSPD_TYPE<ARSPD_TYPE>` = 8 (DroneCAN)"
msgstr ":ref:`ARSPD_TYPE<ARSPD_TYPE>` = 8（DroneCAN）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-kitcan.rst:98 9a80d21140c54673af35a67871738997
msgid ""
"If the attached sensor is not an MS5525 type with I2C address 0x76, then you"
" must access your KitCAN's CAN parameters to select Airspeed type being "
"attached to the adapter. Using Mission Planner (or :ref:`common-uavcan-"
"gui`), go to the menu SETUP/Optional Hardware/DroneCAN/SLCan Mode "
"CAN1/Parameters. Once the CAN Adapters parameters appear, change the "
"following (this changes them inside the DroneCAN adapter, NOT the autopilot,"
" allowing the adapter to use the correct driver and convert the information "
"to DroneCAN airspeed format):"
msgstr ""
"如果所连接传感器不是 I2C 地址为 0x76 的 MS5525 类型，则必须访问 KitCAN 的 CAN "
"参数以选择连接到适配器的空速传感器类型。通过 Mission Planner（或 :ref:`common-uavcan-gui`），进入 "
"SETUP/Optional Hardware/DroneCAN/SLCan Mode CAN1/Parameters 菜单。CAN "
"适配器参数出现后，更改以下内容（这是在 DroneCAN 适配器内部修改，而非飞控，以便适配器使用正确的驱动程序并将信息转换为 DroneCAN "
"空速格式）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-kitcan.rst:100
#: 6256b5793a944bc5bd43709fdc8dd1ea
msgid ""
":ref:`ARSPD_TYPE<ARSPD_TYPE>` = 4 (is default for an I2C-MS5525 with an 0x76"
" address which prevents conflict with the DSP310 integrated onboard with "
"address 0x77). If another sensor is used, change the type to match that "
"sensor."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ARSPD_TYPE<ARSPD_TYPE>` = 4（默认用于 I2C 地址为 0x76 的 MS5525，以避免与板载地址为 0x77 "
"的 DSP310 冲突）。如果使用其他传感器，请将类型更改为匹配该传感器的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-kitcan.rst:101
#: 1e2d04a725484f5a8302a47f733bee8b
msgid ":ref:`ARSPD_USE<ARSPD_USE>` =  1"
msgstr ":ref:`ARSPD_USE<ARSPD_USE>` = 1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-kitcan.rst:102
#: 0805608f7f0f45c290dbc7c3b1dc82d7
msgid ":ref:`ARSPD_BUS<ARSPD_BUS>` =  0"
msgstr ":ref:`ARSPD_BUS<ARSPD_BUS>` = 0"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-kitcan.rst:104
#: df33997b1f774a49aa3512b86cbf8400
msgid "Then reboot."
msgstr "然后重启。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-kitcan.rst:107
#: 34fde252bfc94e6aa110184cfca02e0a
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-kitcan.rst:109
#: d52bcbef94394044a8d9d4e63ffdd69a
msgid ""
"This device uses the \"f303-M100025\" firmware located at "
"https://firmware.ardupilot.org/AP_Periph. See the :ref:`SLCAN section of "
"DroneCAN advanced setup<common-uavcan-setup-advanced>` for downloading "
"instructions, if changes are desired or updates become available."
msgstr ""
"该设备使用位于 https://firmware.ardupilot.org/AP_Periph "
"的「f303-M100025」固件。如需更改或有更新可用，请参阅 :ref:`DroneCAN 高级设置的 SLCAN 部分 <common-"
"uavcan-setup-advanced>` 获取下载说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-kitcan.rst:112
#: e4b195f0e3b34cf88724b372f35601e0
msgid "Where to Buy"
msgstr "购买渠道"

